  "id": "peanut-butter-crisp-cereal-cookies",
  "name": "Peanut Butter Crisp Cereal Cookies",
  "subtitle": "Chewy drop cookies with crisp cereal",
  "description": "A quick stovetop confection combining peanut butter, sweet syrup, and crisp cereal into easy-to-shape cookies.",
